==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*6 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

